<title>USA: Bellwether offers $209 mln for oil/natgas.</title>
<headline>Bellwether offers $209 mln for oil/natgas.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bellwether Exploration Co said Friday it has offered to acquire interests in oil and natural gas properties from 24 limited partnerships and other entities formed by Torch Energy Advisors Inc for $209 million, including an estimated $23.2 million of working capital, plus a contingent payment not to exceed $10 million.</p>
<p>Torch said it has approved the offer and told Bellwether that it will recommend its offer to stockholders.</p>
</text>
